  "caveats": [
    "The U script is followed in isolation, taking the deg-lex-greatest image word as each step's successor. That is a heuristic for 'which word did this term become' and is sound only while the lineage has not split -- which the quadratic step does, so read the script past its Q step as one branch of two.",
    "Reaching an endpoint is necessary, not sufficient: a stretch that transfers still has to compose on the nose, and this arc's record on 'remaining work is just wiring' is poor."
  ]
